; half of the music bed under the video manual (SP-1 and Wingie): a plucked string, a marimba and a bell, rung by
; dust, rain and a little wind, three chords as three scenes in a long dark cavern. An SP-1
; dream (no instrument line): every scene fits the SP-1, under 85 %. Rendered by bed.c.

C and E minor
-------------
the motes is dust 1
the drops is rain 1
the air is wind
the low is string 2
the mid is marimba 4 tune=7st
the high is bell 4 tune=16st
the soft is onepole 20
the under is cavern samplerate=quarter size=0.6 dark=0.7
air ~20> low.pluck
motes -> low.pluck mid.strike
drops.pulse ?12> high.strike
low mid -> soft
high ~30> soft
soft ~> under
under.left soft ~> left
under.right soft ~> right

